  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kinshasa Poultry Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to set up a poultry platform in Kinshasa, the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DR Congo), that provides a permanent consultation framework and constructive dialogue between public and private stakeholders. This is expected to increase trust between actors at all levels and to contribute to a favourable environment for the development of the DR Congo&apos;s poultry sector.The goal is to contribute to the reinforcement and development of the skills of the various key players as well as learning and knowledge transfer between experts in the sector.The platform will be set up in collaboration with the Congolese Ministry of Fisheries and Livestock.</narrative>
  </description>
